# ${FEATURE_NAME}/

Feature folder for `${FEATURE_NAME}`. Stamped from the `_feature_template/`.

## What lives here

| Subfolder | What lives here | File suffix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [`routes/`](routes/) | Route registration for this feature | `*.routes.ts` |
| [`controllers/`](controllers/) | Request handlers — call the service, format the response | `*.controller.ts` |
| [`services/`](services/) | Business logic | `*.service.ts` |
| [`types/`](types/) | Request/response and domain types | `*.types.ts` |

## What does NOT live here

- DB models — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/models/` as `<entity>.model.ts`.
- Cross-cutting middleware — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/middlewares/`.
- Pure utility code — that lives in `${SRC_DIR}/lib/`.

